/- English proof (translation)
Establish an intermediate fact. Prove the components needed by the constructor for the conclusion. Fix the arbitrary inputs or assume the hypotheses. Establish an intermediate fact. Establish an intermediate fact.

Simplify to obtain the desired conclusion from the available facts.
-/
theorem sec_subsingleton {R : Type} [CommRing R] (G : Shv R) (X : Scheme.{0}) [IsEmpty X] :
    Subsingleton (G.obj.obj (op X)) := by
  have h := Sheaf.isTerminalOfBotCover G X (Scheme.bot_mem_grothendieckTopology X)
  constructor
  intro a b
  have e := h.hom_ext (ModuleCat.ofHom (LinearMap.toSpanSingleton (ULift.{1} R) _ a))
    (ModuleCat.ofHom (LinearMap.toSpanSingleton (ULift.{1} R) _ b))
  have := congrArg (fun f => f.hom (1 : ULift.{1} R)) e
  simpa using this

/- English proof (translation)
Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Reduce the claim to the hypotheses of an applicable result. By extensionality, compare the relevant components. Separate the alternatives or extract the components of the hypothesis. Establish an intermediate fact.

